msgstr "Extend group to move {0}"

msgid "training.combo.moves.group.detail"
msgstr "A group is a run of neighbouring moves, shown with their numbers in brackets. Start it on one move, highlight another and extend: every move between joins. G on a move's row does the same. The group lasts until you leave this screen."

